.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc142wj.jpg"}, {"id": 1869963, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc142vf.jpg"}, {"id": 1869964, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc142vg.jpg"}, {"id": 1869965, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc142vh.jpg"}, {"id": 1869966, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc142vi.jpg"}], "slug": "chaos-agents", "summary": "Chaos Agents is the world\u2019s first autobattler-royale, a genre-defying strategy game from Richard Garfield, creator of Magic: The Gathering, and the debut title from Popularium. In Chaos Agents, players coach a globally unique superhero\u2014known as a Chaos Agent\u2014through intense auto-battling skirmishes against dozens of others in a large-scale battle royale.\n\nUsing strategic card play, players power up their Agent between rounds, then watch their choices unfold in action-packed, hands-off combat. With every Agent being one-of-a-kind and globally exclusive, mastery becomes personal\u2014and competitive. Combining the tactical depth of auto-battlers with the high-stakes scale of a battle royale, Chaos Agents invites players to discover, upgrade, and dominate in a new genre born from community-driven development.", "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/chaos-agents", "videos": [{"id": 156961, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "zY9eIDkv6CY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zY9eIDkv6CY", "title": "Chaos Agents Announcement Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/zY9eIDkv6CY/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}